{"ref":"BDB, יוֹרָה²","hw":"יוֹרָה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי י׳</span> one of the families of the restoration <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:18\" href=\"/Ezra.2.18\">Ezr 2:18</a> (𝔊 Ουρα, Ιωρα) = <span dir=\"rtl\">חָרִיף</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:23\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.23\">Ne 7:24</a> (𝔊 Αρειφ).","next":"BDB, יוֹרֶה","prev":"BDB, יָרָה"}